+
+## Decisions & Alternatives
+
+| Decision | Chosen | Alternatives Considered | Rationale |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| Lookup backend | Local embedded SQLite index, rebuilt on-kiosk from each snapshot | On-site HTTPS directory (one central index, smaller kiosk updates, but lookups depend on the lab network and need timeout handling); managed search service (less index maintenance, room for richer search, but recurring cost, credentials, and external connectivity) | Only the embedded index satisfies the HLD tenet that lookup completes on kiosk files with no runtime network access; the other candidates require a network route the kiosks do not have during normal operation. `findBySerial(serial)` and its result type are unchanged by this choice. |
